Add nineteen fighters and fifteen native costume variants

Add six Survive creatures, eight Peace Walker boxes and five Gekko/Tripod assemblies with independent native facings. Integrate fifteen painted costumes, private player wardrobes and qualified existing or derived appearances. Align body and machine physics with qualified height references, and pin the new weapon axes while preserving legacy projectiles.

Preserve historical sources and raw review evidence. Document original adaptations and the remaining native wardrobe and reference backlog.

Validated705 application tests, build/PWA/runtime checks, and actual costume, replay, smoke/STN and Gekko matches. Absolute1:1 fidelity is not certified.
